 generic column for 'matches a club appeared in' (that needs home_club_id = X OR away_club_id = X). Ask about wins, home games or away games specifically for a clean answer."],"tryPrompts":[{"text":"Which clubs have won the most premierships?","chart":"hbar"},{"text":"Average winning margin by season","chart":"line"},{"text":"Show every AFL venue on a map","chart":"point_map"},{"text":"List the matches with the biggest winning margins","chart":"table"},{"text":"What fraction of matches end in a home victory, an away victory, or a draw?","chart":"donut"},{"text":"Distribution of total match scores","chart":"histogram"},{"text":"Collingwood's wins per season since 2000","chart":"bar"},{"text":"Ladder positions of the Swans by year","chart":"line"},{"text":"How many premierships has Essendon won?","chart":"kpi"},{"text":"Show the margin and total score for every Grand Final","chart":"scatter"},{"text":"Matches hosted by state","chart":"hbar"},{"text":"Grand final margins over time","chart":"line"}],"defaultFact":"seasons","schemaHash":"573a16ad9999b2a4","attribution":"Match, team and ladder data: Squiggle (squiggle.com.au). Not endorsed by or affiliated with the AFL or Squiggle.","license":"Squiggle-API-terms"}